WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:10.109
Front door: In through the glass door on the left of the shopfront.

2
00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:15.609
Check in: At the café counter, which is also the front desk, show your passport and pay the 100,000 kip deposit for your padlock and towel.

3
00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:21.356
Shoes off: Take your shoes off at the foot of the stairs and carry them up.

4
00:00:21.356 --> 00:00:26.231
Shoes: Leave your shoes in the cubbies on the Floor 1 landing.

5
00:00:26.231 --> 00:00:34.231
Pod H01: Find your pod by its number (H01 is a top bunk, up its ladder) and the locker with the same number.
